# ---- Video and audio files are NEVER pushed to Git or the cloud ----
# Finals (renders/final/), iterations (renders/vN/), stems and captures all stay on the local machine.
# The 12 finals committed before 2026-10-01 stay tracked as legacy Git LFS files; add no new ones.
*.mp4
*.MP4
*.mov
*.MOV
*.m4v
*.webm
*.mkv
*.wav
*.WAV
*.aif
*.aiff
*.flac

# Frame captures and render caches
**/frames/
**/frames_*/
**/steps/
**/steps_w/
**/hd/w/*.png
**/hd/v/*.png

# Dependencies / toolchain caches
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
.remotion/
**/.remotion/
.cache/
**/.cache/
__pycache__/

# Pre-GitHub local history (2026-09-13 initial commit), kept only on the Mac
.git-local-history-*/

# Logs and OS junk
*.log
npm-debug.log*
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# supu-replay-pipeline scratch output
tools/supu-replay-pipeline/out/
tools/supu-replay-pipeline/shots/
tools/supu-replay-pipeline/hd/*.info
**/hd/v7/
**/hd/v7.info
**/hd/t6w/
